      "updated": 1790402527894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Supervised as a child process, but a\nseparate program: the desktop app can\nreconnect to a running daemon, and a\nreplacement daemon reattaches to the\ndetached ACP host without stopping an\nin-flight turn.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
